Taken unchanged from Hard Corps Uprising ReXGlue patch 0009 (guest-fence-wake); it applies as is on top of 0001-0084.
Wakes host threads blocked on a guest memory word after the command processor writes it (EVENT_WRITE_SHD, MEM_WRITE,
COND_WRITE to memory, REG_TO_MEM): WakeByAddressAll on Windows. The GPU plugin gets `synchronization.lib`. Without the
game-side hook (drafts/mua-gpu_fence_wait.cpp) nothing waits on the word, so the patch alone only costs one cheap
WakeByAddressAll per memory write (a few per frame).

